<InfoPage title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy policy" slug="privacy" updated="2026-11-26"
  description="What AtlasFigures collects (nothing personal today), how the offline app feature, search history and the Your country card work, and how we will tell you about any change.">
  <p>AtlasFigures does not ask for, collect or store personal information.</p>
  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>We do not currently use cookies, analytics or advertising trackers. If we add analytics or advertising in future, we will update this page before doing so and explain what is collected and how to opt out.</p>
  <h2>Offline use</h2>
  <p>When you visit, your browser may keep copies of pages you have opened so they still work without a connection, like an app. These copies stay on your device and you can remove them by clearing your browser's site data.</p>
  <h2>Search</h2>
  <p>The search box remembers the last few country and ranking pages you opened, so it can show them under "Recently viewed". This short list is kept only in your own browser's local storage, is never sent to us or anyone else, and is removed when you clear your browser's site data.</p>
  <h2>Your country</h2>
  <p>The "Your country" card on the home page does nothing until you tap it. It then guesses your country from your device's time zone, on your device, without asking for your location and without sending anything to us. If you choose or confirm a country, that choice is kept only in your own browser's local storage; tap "Forget" or clear your browser's site data to remove it.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is served by GitHub Pages. Like any web host, GitHub may record technical information such as your IP address in its server logs for security and reliability. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>Our fonts are served from our own site, so no font service receives your visit.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy can be raised through our contact page.</p>
</InfoPage>
